Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): yamt --diff=<range> opens the range window;
 open_range and load_range_file

---
 .omp/run/notes/RVShell.md  |  98 ++++++++++++++++++
 src-tauri/AGENTS.md        |   2 +-
 src-tauri/src/args.rs      | 136 +++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src-tauri/src/commands.rs  |   9 +-
 src-tauri/src/ipc_error.rs |  45 +++++++++
 src-tauri/src/lib.rs       |   8 +-
 src-tauri/src/range.rs     | 201 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src-tauri/src/window.rs    |  14 ++-
 8 files changed, 495 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 .omp/run/notes/RVShell.md
